{
  "argument_loc": "Global",
  "description": "Returns selection position in model space pertaining to the current animation in [[Simulation vs Render Time Scope|render time scope]].\nWhen the default syntax is used, command searches first in Memory [[LOD]], then in Geometry LOD, FireGeometry LOD, LandContact LOD, HitPoints LOD and finally in ViewGeometry LOD and returns the first matching find.\nThe second syntax allows to specify which one of these LODs to search in instead.\n{{Feature|important|\nSometimes internally \"ViewGeometry\" could be equal to \"Geometry\", and \"FireGeometry\" could be equal to \"ViewGeometry\".\nIn order to pinpoint the actual LOD, use [[allLODs]] and [[LOD_resolutions|LOD resolution]] as argument for selecting the LOD.<br><br>\nAlso note that similar models can have different LOD indexes, for example a soldier model differs from a model of civilian in this regard.\n}}",
  "effect_loc": "Unspecified",
  "examples": [
    "<sqf>_inModelPosition = player selectionPosition \"head_hit\";</sqf>",
    "<sqf>_inModelPosition = player selectionPosition \"pelvis\";</sqf>",
    "<sqf>_inModelPosition = player selectionPosition \"head\";</sqf>",
    "<sqf>_inModelPosition = player selectionPosition \"camera\";</sqf>",
    "<sqf>\nstomper selectionPosition [\"wheel_1_1\", \"HitPoints\", \"FirstPoint\"];\t// [-0.774058,0.860854,-1.40365]\nstomper selectionPosition [\"wheel_1_1\", \"HitPoints\", \"AveragePoint\"];\t// [-0.597142,1.35486,-1.58345]\nstomper selectionPosition [\"wheel_1_1\", \"HitPoints\", \"BoundingBox\"];\t// [[-0.774058,0.860854,-2.07746],[-0.420225,1.84887,-1.08944]]\n</sqf>"
  ],
  "groups": [
    "Object Manipulation",
    "Render Time Scope"
  ],
